---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import { url } from '../data/site';
const { current = '' } = Astro.props;
const services=[
 {id:'speech',label:'Speech Therapy',icon:'voice',url:'/top-speech-therapy-center-india-proven-improvement-rate',copy:'Communication for needs, choices, learning, relationships and participation.'},
 {id:'occupational',label:'Occupational Therapy',icon:'home',url:'/best-occupational-therapy-center-india-proven-improvement-rate',copy:'Everyday activities, play, self-care, routines and school participation.'},
 {id:'aba',label:'ABA Therapy',icon:'heart',url:'/best-aba-therapy-center-india-proven-improvement-rate',copy:'Individual, respectful support for useful skills and everyday behaviour goals.'},
 {id:'education',label:'Special Education',icon:'book',url:'/best-special-education-center-call-9100181181',copy:'Learning access, classroom participation and abilities used in education.'}
];
---
<section class="section therapy-together" id="whole-child-support" aria-labelledby="therapy-together-title"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="split-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">One child. One life. One direction.</p><h2 id="therapy-together-title">Each therapy has a role.<br/><em>Your child’s whole life gives it purpose.</em></h2></div><p>A car works because every part serves the journey. A home works because every room serves the people who live there. In the same way, therapy techniques matter most when they help your child communicate, manage everyday life, learn and participate with growing independence.</p></div>
  <div class="therapy-together-grid">{services.map(service=><article class:list={{'is-current':service.id===current}}><span><Icon name={service.icon} size={30}/></span><h3>{service.label}</h3><p>{service.copy}</p><a href={url(service.url)}>{service.id===current?'You are here':service.id==='occupational'?'Occupational Therapy':'Explore '+service.label} →</a></article>)}</div>
  <div class="therapy-together-close"><Icon name="compass" size={32}/><p><strong>Pinnacle’s life-first approach connects the work.</strong> Assessment, suitable therapies, family-guided practice, progress review and correction keep returning to the same question: what helps this child take part in more of everyday life?</p><a href={url('/verify/evidence/pinnacle-paradigm-shift.html')}>See the documented paradigm shift →</a><a href={url('/autism-therapy')}>See the integrated Autism Therapy pathway →</a></div>
  <p class="source-note">A child may need one service or a combination. Recommendations, goals and progress depend on individual assessment and professional review with the family.</p>
</div></section>
